sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Visitor
  participant W as AniBot widget
  participant H as useAiChat hook
  participant F as chat.js Function
  participant O as OpenAI
  U->>W: types a question and presses Enter
  W->>H: sendMessage with text
  H->>H: adds user bubble and shows typing dots
  H->>F: POST /api/chat with message and last 10 turns
  F->>F: checks origin length and roles
  F->>O: chat.completions.create stream true
  O-->>F: delta content chunks
  F-->>H: text/plain bytes as they arrive
  H->>H: first chunk creates assistant bubble
  H->>H: flush setMessages at most every 40 ms
  O-->>F: stream ends
  F-->>H: stream closes
  H->>W: final flush with complete text
  W->>U: shows Markdown reply and follow ups
